														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3774717">
									

<p>The rework is complete. First and foremost, tremendous thanks to the reviewers who helped me out with this! <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404533); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1404533&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1525306339" alt="Zyn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404533)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404533); return false;">Zyn</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drblackbox" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2785951); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2785951&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1525306339" alt="Drblackbox" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2785951)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drblackbox" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2785951); return false;">Drblackbox</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/apoplexic" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2767424); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2767424&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1525306339" alt="Apoplexic" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2767424)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/apoplexic" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2767424); return false;">Apoplexic</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/septemberjackal" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3207203); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3207203&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1525306339" alt="SeptemberJackal" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3207203)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/septemberjackal" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3207203); return false;">SeptemberJackal</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leveritas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1558990); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1558990&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1525306339" alt="Leveritas" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1558990)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leveritas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1558990); return false;">Leveritas</a></span>, I couldn’t have done this without you all! Let’s get into the change-log.</p>
<ol>
<li>SCP-3660’s stock photo image has been changed out with that of an actual broken zipper. I picked it off the ground at my university so it should be public domain.</li>
<li>Images of animals are all either public domain or CC0 licensed. Links are: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Carcharodon_carcharias.jpg" target="_blank">shark</a>, <a href="https://pixabay.com/en/peacock-colorful-feather-blue-2352723/" target="_blank">peacock</a> and <a href="https://www.pexels.com/photo/cute-cute-animals-pet-portrait-rat-365468/" target="_blank">rat</a>.</li>
<li>The language has been greatly expanded and tightened. Reading should be more pleasurable, flowing and less robotic.</li>
<li>The characters of Scarcliffe and Hanssen(formerly Wallace) have been expanded upon and given more nuance.</li>
<li>SCP-3660 is now kept in Site-64.</li>
<li>SCP-3660 Formatting for the addenda has been improved to be cleaner.</li>
<li>A nice little graphic note has been added to start off the whole thing.</li>
<li>The CoMARP has been added to the article. Credits to both <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404533); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1404533&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1525306339" alt="Zyn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404533)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404533); return false;">Zyn</a></span> and <a href="http://acronymcreator.net/ace.py" target="_blank">this acronym creation website.</a></li>
</ol>
<p>Hope you enjoy!</p>

